--- docs cwd contract ---
3:Terminal tools provide stateless non-interactive command execution for agents plus PID-keyed background process management. Interactive PTY terminal sessions are a separate server/web terminal capability and are not used by the agent `run_bash` tool.
7:- Interactive terminal backend designs (server/web terminal session path):
10:- Agent `run_bash` command execution is the non-interactive path documented in this file; it does not use those interactive session backends.
15:- **`run_bash` is stateless** — each call runs the supplied command through a non-interactive shell in the resolved `cwd`. Do not rely on `cd` or exported variables from earlier calls.
